From e7c642e0d5206a43f23628641c261086fef5fb54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Edges Dev <dev@edgesenterprise.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 07:28:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): port entire frontend to u1core.com dark premium
 theme

- Adopt dark theme (#090909 bg, #FED500 gold accent, #111111 cards)
- Rewrite all page components: Home, About, Services, Products, Contact, Careers
- Update Navbar with refined links and gold CTA button
- Update Footer with 4-column dark layout
- Redesign auth pages: Login, Signup, ForgotPassword, ResetPassword
- Dark theme Dashboard with gold active states
- Update Testimonial carousel with dark cards
- Update Dropdown, AddServices, AddProducts, UpdateMe, AddPicture
- Update tailwind config, global CSS, and index.html meta
- Preserve all routes, API logic, Zustand store, and auth flows
